Stogir and IR
-------------

coil-stogir-declarative implements a backend in DSLs. It draws on prior
work from coil-stogir, Jimmy Miller's Coil port of IR. The graph
representation, optimization passes, split-interval register allocation,
and machine-code emission use IR as a design reference.

