TPDE and CIR
------------

Coil's original direct code generator was coil-tpde, Jimmy Miller's Coil
port of TPDE. It introduced CIR and served as the reference and performance
baseline for this project's direct compilation path. The operation numbers
and operand shapes in src/cir/cir.ops come from that CIR lineage. The DSL
version adds operation semantics used by the reference interpreter and
instruction selector.

