External components
-------------------

The native CIR implementation and assembler come from the Coil dependency
in Coil.toml. The maintained Coil tree carries their TPDE lineage and
licensing in src/declarative/native/NOTICE and its accompanying license files.
The historical benchmark under tools/old-bench uses an external checkout of
coil-stogir. coil-tpde also credits Alexis Engelke's BSD-3-Clause fadec and
disarm64 projects in its own NOTICE. Those encoder libraries are external
prior art. This checkout describes its target encodings in .isa files.
